cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  vn-gross-flows: a panel of Vietnamese open-ended fund flows from Appendix XXIV
  regulatory filings
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: 10thirtyLabs
    email: mai@10thirtylabs.com
abstract: >-
  A reproducible panel of Vietnamese open-ended fund flows built from Appendix
  XXIV of Circular 98/2020/TT-BTC. The dataset preserves disclosed gross
  subscription and redemption legs, canonicalises DCBC as DCDE's legacy
  identity, validates within- and cross-filing boundaries independently of the
  NAV identity, and documents every exclusion. The current corrected build has
  18 economic funds across 4 managers. Forecast features are strictly lagged;
  bond and deposit-rate results are exploratory.
keywords:
  - fund flows
  - mutual funds
  - Vietnam
  - frontier markets
  - flow-performance
  - regulatory disclosure
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.1.0
date-released: '2026-08-16'
